 "remarks": "Charming 1900 Westside Colonial blending timeless character with thoughtful updates. This 3-bedroom, 1-bath home features hardwood floors throughout and a warm, inviting layout filled with natural light. The walk-up attic is fully floored and offers exciting potential to be finished into additional living space-ideal for a home office, guest suite, or playroom. Lovingly cared for, the home includes a newer furnace and hot water heater for added peace of mind. Step outside to a level, tree-lined backyard, perfect for relaxing, gardening, or entertaining. Enjoy a prime location just moments from Mill River Park, Jackie Robinson Park, and downtown Stamford's shops, dining, and amenities. Commuters will love the easy access to I-95 and the train station. Don't miss this opportunity to own a classic home with room to grow in a highly convenient location-schedule your private showing today! Property is being sold As Is.",
